{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Bass in Fish Out Of Water</strong> is a short, witty, narrative-driven detective game where the player follows clues in order to uncover a murderer. Follow along as the mystery unravels and piece together the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY DRIVEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime ruins everything. This time, it has ruined your vacation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sailing in a luxury cruise, Mr. Salomon Chinhook has been turned into fillet. It's your job to find the murderer. Did he have any enemies? Who could have something to gain from his demise? Is there anyone with the motive and the means to pull off such a heinous atrocity? It's up to you, Detective Bass, to speak to suspects, take notes, and poke holes in their stories!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NOTEBOOK FULL OF QUESTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Scribbling noises</strong>*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll take notes when speaking to guests. These notes will provide you useful information, as well as allowing you to ask questions and further unravel the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/d79c639359038776918551be7fe50672.poster.avif?t=1762954845\" width=454 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/d79c639359038776918551be7fe50672.webm?t=1762954845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/d79c639359038776918551be7fe50672.mp4?t=1762954845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BOAT-LOAD OF FUN GUESTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the suspects!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about 8 witty and interesting characters... one of which is a murderer! Use your gigantic fish brain to point fingers and take the culprit to justice!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/effd320f09596b6c3e483b144dec6f3b.poster.avif?t=1762954845\" width=446 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/effd320f09596b6c3e483b144dec6f3b.webm?t=1762954845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/extras/effd320f09596b6c3e483b144dec6f3b.mp4?t=1762954845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106150?t=1762954845","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106150?t=1762954845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/a5bb4c1ebe57491b63dafa122f8df740f4af53f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762954845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106150/a5bb4c1ebe57491b63dafa122f8df740f4af53f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762954845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Bass in Fish Out Of Water</strong> is a short, witty, narrative-driven detective game where the playe